++  --planning-document-mode extract off, discover, download, or embedded-text extraction
++  --planning-document-max-applications 80
++                                    Maximum planning applications inspected per build
++  --planning-document-max-documents 240
++                                    Maximum geometry-relevant files selected per build
++  --planning-document-max-mb 25    Aggregate cache-only document download limit
++  --planning-document-max-pages 5  PDF pages inspected with pdftotext when available
++  --planning-document-min-score 35 Minimum filename/link classification score
++  --planning-document-license TEXT Optional explicit reuse licence for downloaded documents
+   --planning-override-mode gated   off, gated, or authoritative OSM replacement policy
+   --planning-override-min-confidence .86
+                                     Minimum planning evidence score for automatic replacement
